# Exercise: Gzip Compression
#
# Gzip is the most widely-used compression format.
# Used in HTTP (Accept-Encoding: gzip), tar.gz files, etc.
#
# compress.gzip ( String -- String Bool )
# compress.gunzip ( String -- String Bool )
#
# Output is base64-encoded for safe text handling.
#
# Your task: Implement gzip compression/decompression
# When done, delete the marker line below.

# I AM NOT DONE

: gzip-compress ( String -- String Bool )
